               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
Content Capability and Requirement Namespace.
 
 </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
 This class defines the names for the attributes and directives for this
 namespace. All unspecified capability attributes are of type {@code String}
 and are used as arbitrary matching attributes for the capability. The values
 associated with the specified directive and attribute keys are of type
 {@code String}, unless otherwise indicated.</fo:block>
               <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                         xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                         space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt"
                         start-indent="0pt"
                         relative-align="baseline">
