                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
Namespace name for content capabilities and requirements.
 
 </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
 Also, the capability attribute used to specify the unique identifier of
 the content. This identifier is the {@code SHA-256} hash of the content.</fo:block>
